From 8bf0c5da3f80a200f696787603b77259a7d9af4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pdale-boop <237306950+pdale-boop@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:51:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Sun shadows: Wind Waker HD's bias, terrain mix and light
 rule; its stage normals from the host

- DOL_AURORA_SUN_SHADOW_MAP_HD_BIAS and _CASTER_BIAS: HD's bias, the lookup moved out
  20 x (1 - |N.L|)^9 along the normal and the casters' depth biased when drawn (constant 80, slope 3, as
  HD draws its map).
- DOL_AURORA_SUN_SHADOW_HD_MIX: HD's terrain shadow mix, the quarter-size pass with the map's
  shadow and HD's grazing term, blurred, mixed in by distance, grazing and nearness to the camera.
- aurora_set_sun_hd_light: HD's light rule from the host (the sun by day, the moon's side by night, HD's
  day/night fade).
- aurora_set_hd_normals: HD's normals for the stage in play, the HD pack's optional/hd-normals/<stage>.bin,
  given by the host as the stage changes.
---
 .../graphics/aurora/include/aurora/aurora.h   |   9 +
 .../graphics/aurora/lib/gfx/gxcore_draw.cpp   |  58 +++-
 GXRuntime/graphics/aurora/lib/gfx/post_fx.cpp | 312 ++++++++++++++++--
 GXRuntime/graphics/aurora/lib/gfx/post_fx.hpp |   2 +
 4 files changed, 339 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

